        "slc_b429f5f463dce5614d3d700b669fab4e34c5e69d6d524cff144bf1083baa0ce1"
      ],
      "text": "Named autopilot profiles currently require Linux with `flock`; unsupported environments reject explicit `--workflow` invocation before changing autopilot state, while legacy autopilot remains available."
    },
