        "slc_42e74c7edb1ea38d81e9d71f5903fba26db4596deadbdca734ace00a37b96e3c"
      ],
      "text": "OMC does not ship a VS Code extension or document extension-specific install flows; interactive slash commands like /autopilot and /team require an active Claude Code session and should not be relied on in CI."
    },
