      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5eeb0edd878f5c230c107db9a79d6efe88409e5e1fd84885d0ce67b763a6e7d7",
        "slc_6bd9c0477f9fe9166b132a12b2e7e7728e6ee1da4fd2643c53ec49fda2ee7eb1",
        "slc_b510821c4b313e39072ae3a45389381ced325b60c901835da9a76b7736be19dc"
      ],
      "text": "OMC writes runtime state, session data, plans, logs, and artifacts under `.omc/` by default; gitignore keeps it local except `.omc/skills/**` which stays committable, and `OMC_STATE_DIR` or a `.omc-workspace` marker can relocate or share state."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ce98890160ea249edd83407136fc2437fa2835f79abf463fd2aa295817dc6488",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "5281b19e0d64f8e6dc6767f2130299a88af2dc71",
          "git_sha": "031dce6f53fc6ea92a3b2c186f9288cb985de405",
          "line_end": 373,
          "line_start": 373,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "yeachan-heo/oh-my-claudecode",
          "url": "https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode/blob/5281b19e0d64f8e6dc6767f2130299a88af2dc71/README.md#L373-L373"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6e69a29930a7029d97de1383cdc7fe15b85badb68fb64c9260a52d034c249b14"
      ],
      "text": "Outside a git repository OMC uses a canonical state root at `~/.omc/` (or `$OMC_STATE_DIR/non-git`) and avoids creating per-cwd state roots or writing into sensitive directories like `~/.ssh` or `~/Downloads`."
    },
